  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Channeling your holy blessing infuses you with righteous exultation.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Reward of Grace<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Each time you use your lay on hands ability, you gain a +1 sacred bonus on attack and damage rolls for a number of rounds equal to your mythic tier. If you heal a good-aligned creature with your lay on hands ability, it also gains a +1 sacred bonus on attack and damage rolls for 1 round. When you use lay on hands to heal yourself, these bonuses stack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc30\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
